    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know. what's there to unpack? it feels like the version of me that existed with him is just... gone. like i'm just a ghost going through the motions. sometimes i wonder if people are even better off when they're just gone. it's like i'm just a burden to everyone i talk to because i can't be \"okay\" again. it would be so much easier if i just didn't have to feel this anymore.",
